url":"https://gitcode.com/xuanyuandy"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178576248,"discussion_id":"b2d620e0a58cf7b7e903caf6cee4feecc151307c","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n本次 PR 修复了 `SLIKLLossVectorService::VectorSy` 函数中循环分片处理时的边界越界问题。原代码在每一轮迭代中均使用固定大小 `nSplitSize`，当总元素数 `gSizeQueryIndex` 不能被 `nSplitSize` 整除时，最后一批迭代会超出有效数据范围。修复通过引入 `curNSize` 变量，取 `nSplitSize` 与剩余元素数量的较小值，确保最后一轮的拷贝参数、乘法循环和 Reduce 形状均基于实际有效数据量，避免越界访问。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **引入 `curNSize` 变量处理尾部批次大小**：新增 `int64_t curNSize = Min(nSplitSize, static_cast<int64_t>(constInfo.gSizeQueryIndex) - n * nSplitSize)`，将每轮实际处理的元素数从固定的 `nSplitSize` 替换为动态计算的 `curNSize`。\n- **`DataCopyExtParams` 构造参数修复**：将 `copyBmm2Params` 的第一个参数由 `nSplitSize` 改为 `curNSize`，确保最后一轮数据拷贝宽度与实际有效数据量一致。\n- **乘法循环边界修复**：内层 `for (int32_t i = 0; i < ...)` 循环的上限从 `nSplitSize` 改为 `curNSize`，避免在尾部批次中访问无效的权重值。\n- **Reduce 形状修复**：`reduceShape` 数组的第一个维度从 `nSplitSize` 改为 `curNSize`，使 ReduceSum 操作的输入形状与实际批次大小匹配。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-04T16:57:34+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-04T16:57:34+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178576520,"discussion_id":"cd7391fa6eab14c1765a5725f3d2dc092a858772","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=3537b826c3c54622a4fd365051123f9e&pipelineRunId=843b8524ea1d4aaf9ed63b290a6d88fd&projectName=CANN'>843b8524ea1d4aaf9ed63b290a6d88fd</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Compile_Ascend_X86</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\